Subject: Preserve native compiler interfaces for the original Game source
Upstream-base: 9046e67aa2077a7eb4ed6e28c9df3c1d3b368f84

Use authoritative audio header linkage, an explicit full-width encoded Terrain
index cast, and emit available original nlStrNCat<char> for native linking.
